# These start out as copies of public/favicon-defaults/* (which stays
# tracked) but Admin > Branding overwrites them in place on the live
# server when someone uploads a custom favicon. Never track them again —
# a future deploy zip must not ship stale files that clobber a live
# upload back to the default.
/public/favicon.ico
/public/favicon-32.png
/public/favicon-16.png
/public/favicon.svg
/public/apple-touch-icon.png
/storage/*.key
